{
  "_README": [
    "Points of interest, which is where residents live and work.",
    "",
    "MTResident carries HomePOI, WorkPOI, CurrentBusStop and",
    "DestinationBusStop: a resident lives at one POI, works at another, and",
    "rides between them. A zone with no POIs has nobody to put in it, which is",
    "why Arini registered as a zone and still reported 0 residents.",
    "",
    "kind maps to the vanilla blueprint: house -> POI_House_C (a home),",
    "office -> POI_Office_C (a workplace). Both are tiny actors -- a scene",
    "component, a GUID, nothing else -- and the class is the only thing that",
    "says which is which.",
    "",
    "FOUR per delivery point, on the delivery point's exact coordinates, one",
    "facing each cardinal direction, alternating home/work. Same spot and same",
    "height as the delivery point itself: that ground is known good, has real",
    "access, and is where anything worth commuting to already is."
  ],
